1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:57,440 --> 00:02:00,610
Greetings, envoy of the Foreign Battlefield.

25
00:02:01,320 --> 00:02:04,250
Greetings, envoy of the Foreign Battlefield.

26
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:09,010
The Foreign Battlefield cleanup will now begin.

27
00:02:09,240 --> 00:02:10,570
Open the gate !

28
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,410
It has been 3 months.

29
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,930
The disciples can exit the valley.

30
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,570
Only 1 of the 7 tokens remains.

31
00:03:01,800 --> 00:03:04,130
It seems the competition was fierce this year.

32
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,690
This will be fun to watch.

33
00:03:05,600 --> 00:03:06,650
What !?

34
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:08,570
One person took all the tokens ?

35
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,810
That's complete nonsense.

36
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:11,770
It's true !

37
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:14,170
He killed almost all of our people !

38
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,450
He's here...

39
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,610
He's here ! This is his aura !

40
00:03:27,600 --> 00:03:29,010
Since you're here,

41
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,250
stop hiding !

42
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,530
Teng Huayuan !

43
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,570
Do you dare to fight me ?

44
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:52,570
He's just Early stage Foundation Establishment.

45
00:03:52,600 --> 00:03:54,570
How can you all be so scared ?

46
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:57,770
Teng Huayuan,

47
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,610
give me my parents' souls !

48
00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,850
Nascent Soul !?

49
00:04:11,640 --> 00:04:15,090
How can a Nascent Soul cultivator enter Jue Ming Valley ?

50
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:18,170
How could you improve your cultivation so much

51
00:04:17,920 --> 00:04:19,730
in such a short time ?

52
00:04:19,640 --> 00:04:21,330
You are the one

53
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:24,450
that made me who I am today !

54
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:37,210
It really is him...

55
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,410
It makes sense if he's Nascent Soul...

56
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,810
Jue Ming Valley only allows

57
00:04:43,560 --> 00:04:46,050
Foundation Establishment cultivators to enter it.

58
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:48,570
How did he become so powerful ?

59
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:51,570
How could someone reach Nascent Soul so quickly ?

60
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:55,090
It's just been a few days

61
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,050
but his cultivation has improved this much...

62
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:04,810
This aura...

63
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:07,210
Middle stage Nascent Soul !?

64
00:05:46,160 --> 00:05:47,250
An illusion ?

65
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:59,530
You deceitful bastard,

66
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,410
show yourself !

67
00:06:02,840 --> 00:06:04,810
He must be too scared to fight

68
00:06:04,600 --> 00:06:06,290
and has fled long ago.

69
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:09,370
He just left a little toy for you to play with.

70
00:06:09,440 --> 00:06:13,090
He even managed to fool all the Ancestors here.

71
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:15,370
Wang Lin, oh Wang Lin,

72
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:17,890
I knew you weren't this skilled.

73
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,490
If you don’t show yourself now,

74
00:06:20,880 --> 00:06:22,650
I hope you won't blame me

75
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:26,210
for crushing your parents' souls !

76
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:29,410
The Soul Flag...

77
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:30,930
Stop !

78
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,410
The first time was an illusion

79
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,890
but this time it's the real you.

80
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:38,850
Wang Lin,

81
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,330
is this all you’ve got ?

82
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,330
Explode !

83
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,650
Blue Ice !?

84
00:06:54,760 --> 00:06:55,970
Interesting...

85
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:59,950
Not only does this kid have Illusion City's Thousand Illusions Bead

86
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:02,490
but he also has the Underworld Sect's Blue Ice.

87
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:04,930
That flying sword is no ordinary weapon either.

88
00:07:04,760 --> 00:07:06,450
Although it's an imitation,

89
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,050
it's still powerful.

90
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:16,130
The real show is yet to come.

91
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,290
It's now or never !

92
00:07:29,240 --> 00:07:30,090
Father,

93
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:31,170
Mother,

94
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:33,730
sorry for being late.

95
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,690
Explode !

96
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:07,050
Formation, activate !

97
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,170
Back then, you killed my grandson.

98
00:08:17,640 --> 00:08:18,650
But today,

99
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:21,410
I will extract your soul and refine it in this Soul Flag.

100
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,370
You will suffer the cruelest of tortures before your death !

101
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,530
I, a Nascent Soul Ancestor,

102
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:33,610
was played by a mere Foundation Establishment brat.

103
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,490
The most frightening thing

104
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:37,570
is how decisive and resilient this guy is.

105
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,970
To prevent the explosion from spreading,

106
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,970
he severed his own arm without any hesitation.

107
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:43,530
If it were anyone else,

108
00:08:43,280 --> 00:08:45,450
I would've admired them.

109
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:47,410
But this kid...

110
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:58,690
I will let you enjoy being devoured by your own parents.

111
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:07,570
Father...

112
00:09:08,920 --> 00:09:09,850
Mother...

113
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,890
Tie Zhu is unfilial...

114
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,530
Without me

115
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,450
you wouldn’t have suffered this fate.

116
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:19,410
Wang Lin,

117
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:21,890
look how kind I am !

118
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:25,250
I let you reunite with your parents...

119
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,170
Father... Mother...

120
00:09:56,240 --> 00:09:58,000
From now on,

121
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,370
your son will never leave you.

122
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:04,090
My fate will depend on this !

123
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:16,370
Did you think

124
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:20,090
I’d let you use that strange teleportation again ?

125
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:26,210
All 7 tokens were destroyed.

126
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:30,650
That means the gate will close very soon.

127
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,730
That old bastard Teng Huayuan !

128
00:10:33,320 --> 00:10:34,850
The last token has been destroyed.

129
00:10:34,680 --> 00:10:37,170
That means the gate to the Foreign Battlefield will close.

130
00:10:36,920 --> 00:10:40,170
500 years... We waited 500 years for nothing !

131
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:42,170
We wasted 500 years...

132
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:44,450
The Corpse Sect's disciples are all dead.

133
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:46,330
That means Luo Sha won't get to enter.

134
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:48,170
So what will he do with my body now ?

135
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,690
Wang Lin...

136
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:52,050
You deserve to have

137
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,570
a painful death.

138
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:59,570
Alright, I'm done playing.

139
00:10:59,760 --> 00:11:01,250
I had already guessed

140
00:11:01,040 --> 00:11:04,650
that you’d try to escape to the Foreign Battlefield.

141
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:09,330
You can give up on that idea.

142
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:13,570
How ridiculous,

143
00:11:14,040 --> 00:11:17,770
how can an Ancestor like me be afraid of a Foundation Establishment brat ?

144
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,610
Go !

145
00:11:47,000 --> 00:11:48,170
Li'er...

146
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,770
Grandfather has avenged you.

147
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:53,890
After his body is devoured,

148
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:56,570
I will extract his soul

149
00:11:57,000 --> 00:12:00,330
and make him suffer the cruelest of tortures.

150
00:12:00,760 --> 00:12:03,220
So what if it was a debt of blood ?

151
00:12:03,040 --> 00:12:05,700
Does the reason really matter ?

152
00:12:05,520 --> 00:12:07,970
The strong prey on the weak,

153
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:09,730
that’s all this is.

154
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,850
You old fool,

155
00:12:11,920 --> 00:12:14,490
we’ve seen this countless times already.

156
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:17,210
Why are you spouting such nonsense now ?

157
00:12:17,720 --> 00:12:19,890
This is the first time in 10 000 years

158
00:12:19,720 --> 00:12:24,250
that a Foundation Establishment cultivator challenged a Nascent Soul Ancestor.

159
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:27,170
His determination is admirable

160
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:29,080
but his situation is pitiful.

161
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:30,690
We should feel ashamed...

162
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:34,530
Is this what the love of a child should be ?

163
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:36,690
Father...

164
00:12:37,040 --> 00:12:37,850
Mother...

165
00:12:38,360 --> 00:12:40,290
Did I make a mistake ?

166
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,130
Heng Yue Sect...

167
00:12:44,680 --> 00:12:45,850
Zhang Hu...

168
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,490
Teng Li...

169
00:12:49,120 --> 00:12:50,130
Wang Family Village...

170
00:12:52,040 --> 00:12:54,210
Is weakness itself a sin ?

171
00:12:58,320 --> 00:13:00,090
Cultivation !

172
00:13:00,560 --> 00:13:02,530
So this is what cultivation is !

173
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:04,130
I get it...

174
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,490
I get it !

175
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:11,250
Killing intent ?

176
00:13:11,040 --> 00:13:12,890
What is this killing intent ?

177
00:13:17,960 --> 00:13:19,040
Father...

178
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,620
Mother...

179
00:13:21,280 --> 00:13:23,010
Tie Zhu is unfilial.

180
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:25,130
If there’s a next life,

181
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:27,130
I hope I won't be your son

182
00:13:27,920 --> 00:13:29,610
because I am...

183
00:13:30,240 --> 00:13:31,690
unworthy.

184
00:13:32,600 --> 00:13:34,530
Sigh...

185
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:51,730
Is this !?

186
00:13:57,640 --> 00:14:00,090
Don't you dare escape with my bead !

187
00:14:09,560 --> 00:14:12,490
The gate to the Foreign Battlefield is closed.

188
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:16,730
None of Zhao's sects qualified to enter !

189
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:28,570
Foreign Battlefield

190
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,330
Senior Sister, have a look !

191
00:14:33,120 --> 00:14:35,050
I’ve already removed half a sleeve.

192
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:35,770
Ma Liang
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

193
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:37,250
Let's not waste time.

194
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,850
We were lucky enough

195
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,970
to have found this piece of armor.

196
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:41,890
Zhou Zihong
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

197
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,010
I had heard that

198
00:14:43,760 --> 00:14:46,920
just breathing the air here boosts cultivation.

199
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,690
We fought so hard to get in

200
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:51,750
but we're just scavenging for armor.

201
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:55,010
Don’t underestimate this armor.

202
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:58,170
Don't you see the Giant Demon Clan's mark on his forehead ?

203
00:14:58,120 --> 00:14:59,650
If we take this armor,

204
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,650
we will have spiritual energy for years.

205
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,730
What’s that ?

206
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,450
Let's follow it.

207
00:15:20,280 --> 00:15:21,570
Is this...

208
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:24,010
A spatial rift.

209
00:15:24,560 --> 00:15:26,200
The Ancestor once said

210
00:15:26,000 --> 00:15:28,490
that during the Foreign Battlefield cleanups,

211
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:30,440
the space might not withstand

212
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,930
the battles between cultivators

213
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:33,490
so it's torn into spatial rifts.

214
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:36,100
If a cultivator is swallowed by a rift,

215
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:37,990
they will become a wandering soul

216
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:40,450
and will never be able to return to the mortal world.

217
00:15:40,920 --> 00:15:42,200
That was a close call.

218
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,690
I'm glad we weren't too close.

219
00:15:43,840 --> 00:15:45,090
Damn spatial rift...

220
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:47,130
You stole one of my treasures !

221
00:15:47,560 --> 00:15:49,850
Where’s the treasure ?

222
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,320
It flew over there

223
00:15:53,160 --> 00:15:55,400
and was swallowed by the spatial rift.

224
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:59,370
A Giant Demon Clan member ?

225
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:02,810
Their people can change their appearance

226
00:16:02,560 --> 00:16:04,530
when they reach Soul Transformation.

227
00:16:05,080 --> 00:16:08,370
Maybe he is Soul Transformation

228
00:16:08,840 --> 00:16:11,650
since he has a human form.

229
00:16:20,760 --> 00:16:22,090
What a pity...

230
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,650
Wang Lin,

231
00:16:34,600 --> 00:16:36,650
I used all my remaining energy

232
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:39,130
to open the gate to the Foreign Battlefield

233
00:16:39,280 --> 00:16:41,490
and save your soul.

234
00:16:42,240 --> 00:16:45,210
I will now fall into a deep slumber.

235
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:48,090
From now on

236
00:16:48,240 --> 00:16:50,130
your fate

237
00:16:50,560 --> 00:16:53,370
is in your own hands.

238
00:16:59,970 --> 00:19:02,100
Killing intent is a fluctuation of spiritual energy around someone reflecting their mental state and intention to kill. The more someone kills, the more killing intent they accumulate in their body and the stronger their killing intent becomes.
You can think of killing intent as an aura around someone that can be sensed by others.

239
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:11,370
I've been walking this path for endless years

240
00:17:07,780 --> 00:17:11,370
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

241
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:16,970
Is it the compass of fate

242
00:17:13,600 --> 00:17:16,970
that wrote this outcome for us ?

243
00:17:16,880 --> 00:17:22,890
The heavens want to erase your existence,

244
00:17:22,760 --> 00:17:28,610
that's the obsession guiding me.

245
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:34,210
Is this the path to uncover

246
00:17:30,520 --> 00:17:34,210
truths from falsehoods ?

247
00:17:34,240 --> 00:17:39,810
In a world of murk and shadow,

248
00:17:36,140 --> 00:17:39,810
only the flame of truth can light the way.

249
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:45,530
Look at them all,

250
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:45,530
being carried by the waves.

251
00:17:45,720 --> 00:17:50,170
Look at them all,

252
00:17:47,880 --> 00:17:50,170
being drowned.

253
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:53,490
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

254
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:56,570
I will let the world refine my soul.

255
00:17:56,450 --> 00:18:02,130
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

256
00:17:58,140 --> 00:18:02,130
I will fight.

257
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:05,250
I'll break through the abyss of despair

258
00:18:05,000 --> 00:18:08,290
to finally learn who I really am.

259
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:13,650
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

260
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:13,650
I embrace this obsession.

261
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:16,610
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

262
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:19,410
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

263
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:24,890
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

264
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:24,890
I'll still fight.

265
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:28,250
It's hard to avoid loneliness

266
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:31,290
when you are above everyone else.

267
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:36,970
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

268
00:18:33,360 --> 00:18:36,970
be afraid of a firefly ?
